<title>USA: Pharmaceutical Resources terminates CFO.</title>
<headline>Pharmaceutical Resources terminates CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING VALLEY, N.Y. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical Resources Inc said Wednesday it terminated its vice president and chief financial officer Robert Edinger.</p>
<p>&quot;It has nothing to do with the finances of this company,&quot; said company Chief Executive Kenneth Sawyer in a telephone interview. &quot;Its totally a collateral matter.&quot;</p>
<p>Dennis O'Connor, controller of the company, in the interim has been named to handle the responsibilities of chief financial officer, the company said.  </p>
<p>The termination occurred Monday, Sawyer said.</p>
<p>O'Connor may remain as the permanent CFO, Sawyer said.</p>
